From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] router: require client API key (VLLM_API_KEY)

Ported from vllm-project/production-stack PR #937 (open), router auth only:
the new src/vllm_router/auth.py and the Depends(verify_api_key) wiring in
app.py. Helm, stale-metrics and metrics_router changes are not taken.

Adaptations to vllm-stack-0.1.13:
  * the dependency is attached to main, files, batches and metrics routers
    (upstream: main_router only), so /v1/*, /engines, /version, /metrics etc.
    all need `Authorization: Bearer <key>`;
  * /health is exempt (liveness probes need no secret);
  * keys are compared with hmac.compare_digest over all keys (upstream used
    `in` on a set), 401s carry WWW-Authenticate: Bearer, keys are never logged.

VLLM_API_KEY may list several comma-separated keys; unset/empty disables auth
(upstream behaviour). Backend auth is unchanged: the PD hops send
OPENAI_API_KEY, the k8s discovery probes send VLLM_API_KEY verbatim (so with
several client keys and k8s discovery, backends must accept that string).
---
diff -ruN a/vllm_router/app.py b/vllm_router/app.py
--- a/vllm_router/app.py	2026-10-12 03:11:08.739466653 +0000
+++ b/vllm_router/app.py	2026-10-12 03:11:25.093011887 +0000
@@ -17,9 +17,10 @@
 
 import sentry_sdk
 import uvicorn
-from fastapi import FastAPI
+from fastapi import Depends, FastAPI
 
 from vllm_router.aiohttp_client import AiohttpClientWrapper
+from vllm_router.auth import verify_api_key
 from vllm_router.dynamic_config import (
     DynamicRouterConfig,
     get_dynamic_config_watcher,
@@ -371,10 +372,13 @@
 
 
 app = FastAPI(lifespan=lifespan)
-app.include_router(main_router)
-app.include_router(files_router)
-app.include_router(batches_router)
-app.include_router(metrics_router)
+# Client auth (VLLM_API_KEY): every router except the /health probe, which
+# verify_api_key exempts by path. Unset key = no auth (upstream behaviour).
+_auth = [Depends(verify_api_key)]
+app.include_router(main_router, dependencies=_auth)
+app.include_router(files_router, dependencies=_auth)
+app.include_router(batches_router, dependencies=_auth)
+app.include_router(metrics_router, dependencies=_auth)
 app.state.aiohttp_client_wrapper = AiohttpClientWrapper()
 app.state.semantic_cache_available = semantic_cache_available
 app.state.otel_enabled = False
